  m_Name: Blade7
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Central Blade
  description: The Central Blade is a critical component of the jet engine, responsible
    for directing the flow of gases and maintaining engine efficiency. Located at
    the center of the engine, it plays a key role in the engine's compressor and
    turbine sections, and is often designed with a unique shape to accommodate the
    engine's central shaft. One interesting detail is that the Central Blade is often
    made from a single piece of material, using advanced manufacturing techniques
    to minimize weight and maximize strength.
